 "text": "9/29/26, 9:39 AM\n\nMove-In/Out\n\nPurpose\n\nThis component enables you to process a customer move-in or move-out. In the case of a move-in, you can create a business\n\npartner and contract account for the customer, or select existing ones. The contracts are then created and allocated to a utility\ninstallation.\n\nIn a move-out, you terminate the customer's contract. If anew customer moves into the installation, the installation is allocated to\nthis customer's contract.\n\nFor more information, see Move-In and Move-Out.\n\nIntegration\n\nLetters to the customer, such as welcome letters and move-out confirmations are created using the Print Workbench component.\nThe SAP Business Workflow component (BC-BMT-WFM) enables you to monitor and configure the workflow processes.\n\nFeatures\n\nYou can have the system trigger a number of activities automatically. You can:\n\ne process the entire transaction immediately and in full.\n\ne create a final bill for the move-out customer.\n\ne create a welcome letter for the move-in customer.\n\nYou can also configure the screen layout to suit your requirements.\n\nMove-In/Out Processing\n\nUse\n\nYou can use Move-In/Out Processing to process the following:\n\ne Move-in/out (move-out with subsequent move-in) for a premise\ne Move-in/out for a business partner\n\ne Move-in\n\ne Move-out\n\ne Contract change\n\nFrom the Move-In/Out initial screen, you can enter search parameters that act as transfer parameters for calling the move-in/out.\n\nTI... LL. ww kL Lg nw 2 LLL OL OCD LIB 2k LLCT ly CC@#=zxxE BLL), LI LT LL Cw 8} wil) Cw eLEOBSamseiee LXER LO.w we ' apopoo gp7 ee\n",
